etumba (Come My Fanatics, Dopethrone); Orange Goblin, Katatonia. El «super-doom» de los Melvins sigue en Seattle con Earth (drones colosales entre La Monte Young y monstruos extraterrestres), Karp, Sunn, y el «sludgecore» del Sur (Eyehategod, Harvey Milk). El stoner rock: Kyuss, Queens Of The Stone Age, Sleep, Fu Manchu, Monster Magnet, Wellwater Conspiracy, Boris.","color":"#f87171","family":"Hard rock, metal y grunge","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#stoner-doom"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":167746229866094,"artist":"Orange Goblin","artist_id":228260948463388,"title":"Frequencies From Planet Ten","year":1997,"ess":0,"yt":"gY-471UjsYI","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Doom, super-doom y stoner rock","scene_id":52427769209791,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#stoner-doom","chapters":["Sección 6.16"],"pages":[[1,288,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":288,"text":"…(2000), whose extended tracks towered over an even more apocalyptic wasteland. During the second half of the decade, bands such as England's Orange Goblin, with Frequencies From Planet Ten (1997), and Sweden's Katatonia, with Discouraged Ones (1998), offered other variants on the stereotype. Super-doom…"}],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":167746229866094,"type":"album","name":"Frequencies From Planet Ten","list_id":64803615322804,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Stoner Metal","src":"musthear","rank":67,"year":1997,"note":null,"yt":"gY-471UjsYI","scaruffi":null},{"id":167746229866094,"type":"album","name":"Frequencies From Planet Ten","list_id":14239102054361,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1997","src":"musthear","rank":168,"year":1997,"note":null,"yt":"gY-471UjsYI","scaruffi":null},{"id":211624760191349,"type":"album","name":"Time Travelling Blues","list_id":64803615322804,"list":